3f29209e576b.plain:
At the start of the Morale phase, choose an enemy unit no more than 12" from a DEATH JESTER model of yours. For the rest of the phase:
• that unit can't be chosen by your opponent for the Insane Bravery Stratagem, and they can't use any rule that would allow them to re-roll a Morale test for it;
• if that unit fails a Morale test, any action it is performing fails straight away.

494320b2a181.plain:
At the start of your opponent's Movement or Charge phase, choose an enemy unit (not one that can FLY) no more than 12" from one of your SHROUD RUNNERS units, then roll one D3:
• mortal wounds equal to the result are inflicted on that enemy unit (but no more than 1 mortal wound per model in it);
• for the rest of the phase, its Move characteristic is reduced by the result (to a minimum of 0");
• for the rest of the phase, your opponent must reduce charge rolls made for it by the result (to a minimum of 0").
This Stratagem can be used only once per turn.

a038df62b66b.plain:
At the start of your Command phase, choose a TROUPE MASTER model of yours on the battlefield, plus a DEATH JESTER or SHADOWSEER model of yours on the battlefield. Until the turn ends:
• the chosen models' Movement characteristic is increased by 2";
• add 1 to any charge roll made for any of the chosen models.
